rephrased_query:
Pursuant to Article 2 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita 2023, I seek a restraining order against an unknown individual who is perpetrating harassment (as defined under BNS) by:

1. Repeatedly making false and intimidatory telephone calls to me;
2. Sending threatening messages to my mobile device or other electronic means;

with the intent to extort money from me (as per Article 3 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita 2023), specifically threatening to cause damage to my property (shop) if I do not comply with their demands.

I request that the authority take immediate action to prevent any further harassment and ensure my safety, as well as investigate the identity of the perpetrator under Article 4 of the Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam 2023.
